{"h":11508,"page":20,"lines":[{"h":0.02183116428435794,"text":"This is not always a question arousing joyful expectation;","conf":1,"x":0.10451306890679847,"y":0.92732558136484677,"w":0.82422801426478787},{"conf":1,"x":0.10213778229753467,"w":0.82422801426478798,"h":0.021825396825396859,"text":"it is often one of distressing anxiety. Shall we pull through?","y":0.90550595200490935},{"w":0.82185269640637681,"text":"our nation asks. Will my work be successful? This we ask","y":0.8821924601874469,"x":0.10451308049039826,"h":0.021877306794363283,"conf":1},{"w":0.82185269640637693,"text":"when heavy duties lie upon us. Will my toil bear fruit? So","y":0.85901162793098051,"h":0.021802325097341368,"x":0.10451307673742918,"conf":1},{"x":0.10451308965904425,"w":0.82185269640637681,"y":0.83720930247413228,"h":0.020429586607312422,"text":"asks the man who has to maintain himself and his family.","conf":1},{"text":"Will the loved one about whom I am worrying be preserved","y":0.81395348884041141,"conf":1,"w":0.81947742808948865,"x":0.10688837253482797,"h":0.020371908233279168},{"x":0.10200535080784362,"text":"for me? So we ask when the life of one we love is in danger.","conf":1,"y":0.79195383833970701,"w":0.82454651671570622,"h":0.023156793344588533},{"h":0.020429585661206895,"text":"I suppose everyone knows the anxiety which robs our nights","y":0.76736111140681196,"x":0.10451306977354535,"w":0.81947742808948865,"conf":1},{"w":0.11638954707554411,"text":"of sleep.","x":0.10451306610593339,"h":0.020452657389262385,"y":0.74553571435172161,"conf":1},{"text":"And not only so. Does not the future demand of us-even","x":0.13539193169656025,"y":0.72238372125320205,"w":0.78859854363775883,"h":0.020423818202245814,"conf":1},{"x":0.10451306792675205,"w":0.81947742808948865,"conf":1,"y":0.69912790712529504,"h":0.020366140774318198,"text":"at times when the skies are brighter for us—that we should"},{"y":0.68023255892962187,"conf":1,"x":0.10451307731511289,"h":0.01744185932098874,"text":"be anxious for the morrow? that we should be concerned","w":0.81947742808948854},{"conf":1,"y":0.65252976144693409,"x":0.10451306637885038,"w":0.81947742808948876,"h":0.023342331250508552,"text":"about our food and drink, and as to how we shall be clothed?"},{"h":0.020458424848223578,"conf":1,"text":"Unceasing care about ourselves and those we love!","x":0.10451307341504421,"y":0.63070436529392326,"w":0.69358667150720366},{"text":"Hence how can Jesus exhort us: \"Do not be anxious\"?","conf":1,"y":0.60901162805552755,"h":0.020452657389262496,"w":0.78859854363775861,"x":0.13539193654216586},{"h":0.020394979015229131,"y":0.58575581450901604,"x":0.10451305980323682,"w":0.81947742808948865,"text":"Of course we should like very much to be able to follow that","conf":1},{"text":"advice. We should like very much to be without a care in the","conf":1,"x":0.1020499552736408,"w":0.82202351557744013,"y":0.5616563066209177,"h":0.022831002871195549},{"h":0.020406514879256932,"conf":1,"y":0.53918650810757418,"text":"world. As every man is urged by anxiety, so everyone knows","x":0.10213779068381525,"w":0.82185269640637693},{"y":0.51736111077316904,"w":0.82185269640637681,"h":0.019097222222222099,"x":0.10213777894306204,"conf":1,"text":"the desire for a carefree life. In legend and fairy tale a"},{"text":"fanciful imagination has always delighted to depict a wonder-","conf":1,"x":0.10213776546261813,"y":0.49418604702618396,"w":0.82422801426478798,"h":0.021802325097341479},{"text":"land in which no one needs to care any longer about sordid","w":0.82185269640637681,"y":0.47093023291017877,"conf":1,"x":0.099762477628165758,"h":0.020389211556268161},{"y":0.44912790745333053,"h":0.01889534791310632,"w":0.27790973712871603,"x":0.10213777079431176,"text":"and material things.","conf":1},{"y":0.42435515884217234,"x":0.13539192530868593,"w":0.78622327532087055,"h":0.021865770930335593,"conf":1,"text":"For everyone feels how care, which directs our attention"},{"w":0.82185269640637693,"x":0.10213778524890975,"y":0.40104166655098805,"text":"from the present to the future, impoverishes and devalues","conf":1,"h":0.021923449304368736},{"w":0.8218526964063767,"h":0.020441121525234585,"conf":1,"text":"the present moment; how through care the centre of gravity","y":0.37936046551676794,"x":0.10213779166221136},{"h":0.021871538389296674,"text":"of our life is transferred to something which has not yet","conf":1,"y":0.35610465167734684,"x":0.10213777857828445,"w":0.8218526964063767},{"conf":1,"text":"sprung into existence, which may not be to-morrow or the","y":0.3328373016054702,"w":0.82422801426478787,"x":0.099762467125326021,"h":0.021825396825396748},{"conf":1,"y":0.31101190432145542,"h":0.021836932689424549,"text":"day after, and which for ever eludes us until the \"last syllable","x":0.10213779303196585,"w":0.82185269640637681},{"conf":1,"x":0.10213778191557651,"y":0.28918650782102939,"w":0.82185269640637693,"h":0.020406514879256932,"text":"of recorded time\". Hence Goethe makes \"Care\" address"},{"conf":1,"w":0.15468670485855698,"h":0.017075930322919652,"y":0.26835156978194386,"x":0.10436686244920931,"text":"Faust thus:"},{"conf":1,"y":0.21653417966138588,"w":0.55614387214957894,"h":0.023369739926050515,"x":0.22311587363344551,"text":"\"Whom I make my own with loathing,"},{"y":0.19469246022378417,"x":0.24703090033857925,"conf":1,"text":"Counts the whole wide world as nothing:","h":0.021877306794363394,"w":0.57482181895862927},{"text":"His eternal gloom surpriseth,","h":0.021802325097341368,"y":0.17151162842153289,"x":0.24465558821396571,"w":0.40380046894023947,"conf":1},{"y":0.1480638901858542,"conf":1,"w":0.45006482012860194,"text":"With each outer sense excelling,","h":0.025998005791315948,"x":0.24655909872633944},{"x":0.24433594766244143,"text":"In his breast hath darkness dwelling.","y":0.12621317261783838,"conf":1,"h":0.023472901374574695,"w":0.51614384836964788},{"w":0.42280286318295957,"conf":1,"y":0.10317460275089019,"h":0.021825396825396859,"text":"He may not by any measures,","x":0.24465557901817966},{"x":0.24465558282896643,"conf":1,"text":"Make him lord of all his treasures.","w":0.48218526468648543,"h":0.018895347913106209,"y":0.08430232627963874},{"h":0.015988372621082103,"conf":1,"y":0.053779069343528718,"text":"24","w":0.035629452048958066,"x":0.49168646193276555}],"w":7029}